@startuml

title notification module 分離 設計差分 sequence 図

autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ParticipantPadding 25
skinparam BoxPadding 10

actor "caller" as Caller
participant "Controller" as Controller
participant "Backend UseCase" as BackendUseCase
participant "TranslationJobPolicy" as TranslationJobPolicy
participant "JobIOService" as JobIOService
participant "Service" as Service
participant "RuntimeEventPublisherPort\n旧 direct runtime port" as RuntimeEventPublisherPort
participant "NotificationSinkPort" as NotificationSinkPort
participant "NotificationDispatcher" as NotificationDispatcher
participant "NotificationPort" as NotificationPort
participant "RuntimeAdapter" as RuntimeAdapter
participant "Wails runtime event" as WailsRuntimeEvent

== 変更前の近すぎる通知経路 ==

Caller -> Controller : query / command
Controller -> BackendUseCase : request DTO を渡す
BackendUseCase -> TranslationJobPolicy : 操作可否を確認する
TranslationJobPolicy --> BackendUseCase : allowed / blocked
BackendUseCase -> JobIOService : 状態事実を取得 / 保存する
BackendUseCase -> Service : 実処理を起動する
Service --> BackendUseCase : 状態事実または処理結果

group 削除予定: UseCase から runtime へ直接近づく
    BackendUseCase -> RuntimeEventPublisherPort : runtime event 用 payload を渡す
    RuntimeEventPublisherPort -> RuntimeAdapter : Wails transport へ送る
    RuntimeAdapter -> WailsRuntimeEvent : 実送信
end

group 削除予定: Controller を途中経過通知へ使う
    Service -> Controller : 途中経過通知を戻す
    Controller -> RuntimeAdapter : runtime event を送る
    RuntimeAdapter -> WailsRuntimeEvent : 実送信
end

BackendUseCase --> Controller : synchronous response
Controller --> Caller : application result

== 変更後の notification module 経路 ==

Caller -> Controller : query / command
Controller -> BackendUseCase : request DTO を渡す
BackendUseCase -> TranslationJobPolicy : 操作可否を確認する
TranslationJobPolicy --> BackendUseCase : allowed / blocked
BackendUseCase -> JobIOService : 状態事実を取得 / 保存する
BackendUseCase -> Service : 実処理を起動する
Service --> BackendUseCase : 状態事実または処理結果

par UseCase が通知事実を渡す
    BackendUseCase -> NotificationSinkPort : 完了事実 / 破棄事実
else Service が通知事実を渡す
    Service -> NotificationSinkPort : 進捗事実 / 完了事実 / 破棄事実
end

NotificationSinkPort -> NotificationDispatcher : dispatch
NotificationDispatcher -> NotificationPort : Wails 非依存通知
NotificationPort -> RuntimeAdapter : transport 送信要求
RuntimeAdapter -> WailsRuntimeEvent : 実送信

BackendUseCase --> Controller : synchronous response
Controller --> Caller : application result

note right of Controller
変更しない:
- Controller -> UseCase の同期 request / response

削除予定:
- Controller を途中経過通知の経路にする接続
end note

note right of NotificationDispatcher
追加予定:
- 通知種別の決定
- redaction
- 送信可否

変更しない:
- 状態判断は持たない
end note

note right of RuntimeAdapter
変更しない:
- Wails runtime event の実送信境界
end note

@enduml
